# Environmental Scientist's enters trigger: Bot1 accepts the "may", and may take any basic land card from the library - here a
# Swamp, though Forest comes first - which is revealed (Revealed) and put into the hand. The Taiga (a nonbasic land with
# basic land types) and the Llanowar Elves (a nonland) are not on offer (`! Bot1.Search(..)`); the library is one card
# smaller (11 to 10) and the Scientist stays on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Forest
Environmental Scientist
Island
Plains
Mountain
Island
Forest
Taiga
Llanowar Elves
Swamp
Mountain
Plains x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Environmental Scientist.Cast
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Search(Taiga)
! Bot1.Search(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Search(Swamp)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Plains; Mountain; Swamp
Bot1.Revealed = Swamp
